1
00:05:34,736 --> 00:05:40,736
Live forever. Hunt forever.

2
00:11:09,473 --> 00:11:15,473
The Last Witch Hunter is a action, adventure,
fantasy film directed by Breck Eisner.

3
00:16:44,210 --> 00:16:50,210
The modern world holds many secrets, but by far the most astounding is that witches still live among us; vicious supernatural
creatures intent on unleashing the Black Death upon the world and putting an end to the human race once and for all.

4
00:22:18,947 --> 00:22:24,947
Armies of witch hunters have battled this unnatural enemy for centuries, including Kaulder, a valiant warrior
who many years ago slayed the all-powerful Witch Queen, decimating her followers in the process.

5
00:27:53,684 --> 00:27:59,684
In the moments right before her death, the Queen cursed Kaulder with
immortality, forever separating him from his beloved wife and daughter.

6
00:33:28,421 --> 00:33:34,421
Today, Kaulder is the last living hunter who has spent his immortal life tracking
down rogue witches, all the while yearning for his long-lost family.

7
00:39:03,157 --> 00:39:09,157
Kaulder, played by Vin Diesel.

8
00:44:37,894 --> 00:44:43,894
Dolan 37th, played by Elijah Wood.

9
00:50:12,631 --> 00:50:18,631
Chloe, played by Rose Leslie.

10
00:55:47,368 --> 00:55:53,368
Belial, played by Ólafur Darri Ólafsson.

11
01:01:22,105 --> 01:01:28,105
The Witch Queen, played by Julie Engelbrecht.

12
01:06:56,842 --> 01:07:02,842
Dolan 36th, played by Michael Caine.

13
01:12:31,578 --> 01:12:37,578
The Last Witch Hunter is a 2015 American fantasy action film directed by Breck
Eisner and written by Cory Goodman, Matt Sazama and Burk Sharpless.

14
01:18:06,315 --> 01:18:12,315
The film stars Vin Diesel as an immortal witch-hunter who must
stop a plague from ravaging the entire world.

15
01:23:41,052 --> 01:23:47,052
The Last With Hunter premiered at the AMC Loews Lincoln Square in New York City on October 13, 2015, and was released in the United States on
October 23, by Summit Entertainment, being the last film distributed by the company before it was absorbed into Lionsgate.

16
01:29:15,789 --> 01:29:21,789
The film received generally negative reviews from
critics, but grossed $146.9 million worldwide.

17
01:34:50,526 --> 01:34:56,526
A sequel is in development.

18
01:40:25,263 --> 01:40:31,263
The film explores themes of witch, new york city,
magic, superstition, black magic.
